# AdSphere – Application Output

## 1. Project Introduction

AdSphere is a Java Spring Boot ment Management System.
Advertise
It allows users to create, view, update, and delete advertisements using REST API endpoints.

## 2. Application Startup Output

When the application starts successfully, the console displays Spring Boot startup information.

