## 11. Conclusion

The AdSphere Advertisement Management System demonstrates CRUD operations using Java, Spring Boot, Spring Data JPA, REST APIs, and an H2 database.

It provides a foundation for building larger advertisement management applications.

**Important:** The responses above are illustrative expected outputs. Run the application and test each endpoint to confirm actual results before claiming all tests passed.
